WEBVTT

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:31.216
But what I have instead is the chance
to make the choice to love someone,

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:34.696
and the hope that he will choose
to love me back,

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:37.416
and it is terrifying,

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:39.176
but that's the deal with love.

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:40.440
Thank you.